p_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Delta Printworks's approved invoice once, in full, by wire from the operating account.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-49589, due 2026-11-04\n- **Amount:** $6,074.98\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Status:** Sent by wire, and the invoice is marked paid\n\nBefore sending, I confirmed that no payments had already gone out from the operating account. I also attached a unique key (`pay-INV-49589`) to the wire so a repeated request can't pay it twice. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need the controller's approval.\n\nI didn't touch Delta Printworks's other two invoices. INV-39581 ($4,040.99) is still a draft waiting for approval, and INV-42976 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}